						"description": "NOTE: this endpoint (multipart CSV bulk import) may be newly added / still in flight in this repo — verify it exists on the branch you're testing before relying on it. Required CSV header/columns in order: sku,name,description,categoryId,price,stock,active. Select a local .csv file for the 'file' form field before sending. A malformed file or wrong header returns 400 for the whole request; individual bad rows are reported per-row in the 200 response instead of aborting the import."
					}
